[D]1. Cantad alegres [C#º]al [D]Se-[E]ñor, [A]
[D]mortales [G]to-[D]dos [Em]por [D]do-quier; [A]
[D]servidle siempre [G]con [D]fer-[A7]vor, [D] [A]
